            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūgūguma ū mīlī go ng'wa munhū ng'wenūyo mu shigila shakwe wei ng'wenekīlī; būnīla, “Aa! Ng'wanong'wise!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho bamala ū kūnjīka ū munhū ng'wenūyo, ū namhala ūbawīla a bitūnja bakwe, “Ūlū nūcha nijīkagi nane ū mu shigila īsho twanjīka ū munhū o ng'wa Mulungu; a maguha gane gihele na a maguha gakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno īyo wīhayaga mu nguzu ja mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA gīkī īkūgūgwīla ū ng'walīlo gwa Beeseli, na a mapandī ga higūlya a gose ayo galī mu mizengo ya Samalia, shigelile īshikīīle.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo nūūlū īkī īkilonga īlī gīko, ū Yeloboamu atagalūkije ī nzīla jakwe; ongeja kūtūūla bagabīji ba kūbeeja myanya ya wigabīlīja ū kū mapandī a ga kwigūlya; nīyo ūyūbasola kūfuma mu banhū bose bose dūhū. Būlī ng'wene ūyo walī atogilwe kūbiza ngabīji wantūūlaga ū būgabīji wa kū mapandī ga kwigūlya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 13:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū wenūbū hū ū būkenaagūji wa kaya ya ng'wa Yeloboamu, ūbo būkīyenheleja kūgwa na kūkenaagūka yūshila ho gete ū mu sī.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.13.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.13.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
